# update is lazy — the function application is deferred until the updated key is accessed
# Accessing an unmodified key doesn't force the update computation
# If update were eager, this would error (calling $error); but it's lazy so we can access y
[update "x" [fn [v] [raise "should not be called"]] [x: 1 y: 2]]
---
